      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#08111b\">\n  <title>세계의 직조자</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      background-color: #222;\n      color: #fff;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    #game-container {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      height: 100vh;\n      background-color: #111;\n    }\n    #game-container h2 {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    #game-container button {\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      margin: 10px;\n      background-color: #333;\n      color: #fff;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    #game-container p {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"game-container\">\n    <h1>세계의 직조자</h1>\n    <h2>마나로 숲·물길·마을을 창조하고 세계 안정도와 인구 목표를 달성하세요!</h2>\n    <button id=\"create-forest\">숲 창조</button>\n    <button id=\"create-paths\">물길 창조</button>\n    <button id=\"create-cities\">마을 창조</button>\n    <p>마나를 조절하여 각 기능을 사용하세요.</p>\n  </div>\n  <script>\n    // Game logic here\n    document.getElementById('create-forest').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      // Logic to create forest\n      alert('숲이 창조되었습니다!');\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('create-paths').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      // Logic to create paths\n      alert('물길이 창조되었습니다!');\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('create-cities').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      // Logic to create cities\n      alert('마을이 창조되었습니다!');\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"
